    "description": "<p>You call out a challenge to one of your enemies, demanding they face you.</p><p>As an <strong>Action</strong>, choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong> of you.</p><p>The target's <strong>Melee</strong> and <strong>Accuracy</strong> are reduced by <strong>-1</strong> when attacking creatures other than you. If it casts an offensive spell that does not target you, then the <strong>Complexity</strong> of the spell is increased by <strong>-1</strong>.</p><p>This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become <strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>.</p>",
